<title>JAPAN: Sony shares continue bull run, Fujitsu also up.</title>
<headline>Sony shares continue bull run, Fujitsu also up.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Corp shares continued their bull run on Wednesday morning as investors flocked to the global blue-chip issue due to its rosy business prospects, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0037 GMT, the shares were up 110 yen at 8,100.</p>
<p>&quot;Whether the indices are down or up, international, bellwether issues are in demand -- Sony and Fujitsu Ltd are perfect examples,&quot; a &quot;Big Four&quot; broker said.</p>
<p>High-tech firm Fujitsu was up 10 yen at 1,230 in trade of 4.29 million shares.</p>
</text>
